PARITY MAPPING  (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported, no raw hex)
  status: HeroStatus            → HealthRowStatus (healthy/degraded/unhealthy/unknown/maintenance)
  DOT_FOR_STATUS/TEXT_FOR_STATUS→ HealthRowStatus.tone (shared TSTone): healthy→success, degraded→
    (bg/text *-400 hues)          warning, unhealthy→danger, unknown→neutral, maintenance→info →
                                  Color.TS.status* tokens (theme-aware light/dark/high-contrast).
  icon?: ReactNode              → @ViewBuilder icon slot erased to AnyView?; hasIcon in Inputs; decorative
                                  (accessibilityHidden), tinted Color.TS.textSecondary.
  label: string (flex-1 truncate)→ Text(Font.TS.body, .medium, textPrimary), lineLimit(1) .tail,
                                  frame(maxWidth:.infinity). Single flexible run, truncates first.
  summary: string (shrink-0)    → Text(Font.TS.caption, status color), fixedSize → holds intrinsic width.
  to (internal) / to+external / → HealthRowActivation .link / .externalLink / .action / .none;
    onClick / neither             precedence to-over-onClick preserved; perform wired by embedder.
  (to||onClick) && <ChevronRight>→ showsChevron = isNavigable; chevron "chevron.right" textMuted.
  hover:bg-white/[0.04]         → Color.TS.surfaceGlass hover fill on interactive rows (Reduce-Motion
                                  aware via TSAnimation.fast); inert rows have none.
  aria-label `{label} — {summary}`→ HealthRowStrings.accessibilityLabel localizable format "%1$@ — %2$@"
                                  (separator/word-order translatable); applied to every variant.
  (web has no hint)             → DISCLOSED native HIG addition: VoiceOver hint — "Opens details"
                                  (internal link/action) / "Opens in your browser" (externalLink); link
                                  vs button trait split by activation kind. No silent drift.
  tokens                        → TSSpacing/TSRadius/Color.TS/Font.TS/TSTone — no Tailwind, no hex.

